  "title": "AudioStreamConnection",
  "description": "Connection health of an AudioStream, independent of whether a voice is playing. - `'connected'`: media data arrives. - `'buffering'`: the source is slow; playback waits for data. - `'reconnecting'`: the connection broke and the stream is reopening it. - `'disconnected'`: the connection is gone and no reconnect is pending.",
